WEBVTT

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.440
Long have I awaited
this moment, human filth.

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:24.860
With the Subterranean and
Deep Sea kings gone,

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:29.410
the Terror Lizard Clan can
at last reclaim rulership of the Earth!

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:41.880
Now leading target towards  point Bravo.

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:43.260
Roger.

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:46.590
We are inbound and on schedule.

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:49.180
We'll be on top of Bravo shortly.

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:16.830
UNPARALLELED PERIL

00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:50.550
And who are you?

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:53.300
Hello? What is it?

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:56.440
What do you mean, come back?!

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:59.060
You're the one who said
some weirdo monster was waking up

00:02:59.060 --> 00:03:00.230
and flew me out here!

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:01.940
Weirdo...?

00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:03.810
That's right.
I was just about to start.

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:06.440
Listen well!
I am the Ancient King.

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:07.990
– As ruler of the dinosaurs
– "Trouble?" So what?

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:09.740
– who once ruled this planet,
– It's not my problem.

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:12.070
– I stand above all other lifeforms.
– Hey, shut it!

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:14.490
Can't you see
I'm on the phone here?!

00:03:14.490 --> 00:03:16.330
I'm so tired of this.

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:19.540
Who's he think he is,
ordering people about?

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.750
Are you done?

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:24.840
What's with the chin?
Trying to be scary?

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:26.960
Should I be intimidated?

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:31.050
Act brave while
you still can, little runt.

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:34.300
Runt?! How dare you!

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:43.230
Ah, so you aren't helpless!

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:48.650
But if you intend to destroy me,
a giant meteor is about the only way.

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:51.150
Fine. I'll do that then.

00:03:51.150 --> 00:03:53.700
Don't make me laugh.

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:07.590
How about another
300,000,000 year nap?

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:21.270
Fist of Flowing Water, Crushed Rock.

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:31.690
It goes something like that.

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:33.860
Want to try?

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:35.820
You both look like quick learners.

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:38.950
I bet you'll get the hang of it  in no time.

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:42.710
This is the cool thing you said
you wanted to show us?

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:43.910
A sales pitch?

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:46.460
I'll pass. You do it, Genos.

00:04:46.770 --> 00:04:48.710
No, I will pass too.

00:04:48.710 --> 00:04:50.880
What I seek is not
the art of self-defense,

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:52.550
but absolute destructive power.

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:53.760
You punks!

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:56.140
You dare mock our fighting style?!

00:04:56.140 --> 00:04:57.760
I, Charanko, the top disciple,

00:04:57.760 --> 00:04:58.970
challenge you—

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:01.560
I give up!

00:05:02.850 --> 00:05:04.810
Is he really your best?

00:05:04.810 --> 00:05:06.770
Yeah...

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:10.480
I heard your dojo was
full of skilled fighters.

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:14.360
Well, one of my disciples went wild.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:17.160
He beat my most skilled students

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:19.700
so badly they're all
out of commission.

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:21.790
The rest got scared and quit.

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:24.260
He's that strong?

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:25.660
What's his name?

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:27.380
Garo...

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:32.130
He was my top disciple at the time,

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:34.930
but I gave him a good
beating and expelled him.

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:36.880
You must pack a punch, old man.

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:40.260
Hey! This is the famed hero "Silverfang!"

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:42.390
Class S hero, rank 3.

00:05:42.390 --> 00:05:44.640
He toys with opponents
as he flows like water,

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:47.480
then delivers a blow like
a raging river smashing huge rocks!

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:49.100
A master of martial arts!

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:53.360
You only became
a hero recently, right?

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:56.150
You'll regret taking
Master Bang lightly!

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:57.780
Enough, Charanko!

00:05:57.780 --> 00:05:59.370
Do not disgrace us.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:02.920
Saitama is many times
stronger than me.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:05.660
Master, you can't be serious...

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:06.910
Mr. Silverfang!

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:09.580
The Association sent me.

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:12.960
An emergency summons has been
issued to all Class S heroes!

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:15.920
Please come to
Association Headquarters.

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:18.880
Oh! Is that you, Mr. Genos?

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:23.140
Since all Class S heroes have
been summoned, please come too.

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:25.890
Is it threat level Dragon?

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:27.560
Here we go...

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:30.350
Charanko, look after the dojo.

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:31.650
Be careful, Master!

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:36.740
If Class S is being summoned,
they may need your help too, Master.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.660
Will you come?

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:41.660
I will...
since I got nothing to do.

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:44.160
HERO ASSOCIATION HQ

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:51.380
Oh ho, Silverfang!

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.170
It's been a while, Atomic Samurai.

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:56.760
I knew you'd come.

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:58.970
And this is the cyborg Genos and...

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:01.390
Hm? Who's this?

00:07:01.780 --> 00:07:03.970
This is the Class B hero Saitama.

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:07.310
His exceptional talent will one day
place him atop Class S, I'm sure,

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:09.140
so we asked him to come.

00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:11.100
Hi, middle-aged hero dude!

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:12.810
Put 'er there!

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:17.050
No handshakes.
I acknowledge only the strong.

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:21.320
Once you've climbed up to Class S,
I'll greet you properly.

00:07:21.510 --> 00:07:23.910
Besides, I'm not middle-aged yet.

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:25.660
I'm only 37.

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:30.040
37 isn't middle-aged?
I had no idea...

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:33.670
Hey, who brought
a Class B nobody along?

00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:36.670
Don't you think it's beneath us?

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:39.970
And even if you were invited,
a polite person would decline. The nerve!

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:42.010
I bet you're only here
for some creepy reason

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:43.760
like getting close to
us Class S heroes.

00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:45.800
You disgust me. Leave.

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:50.640
What's with this sassy...
lost child?

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:53.520
That is Tornado. Class S, rank 2.

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:55.810
– "That"? I am not an object!
– She defeats monsters

00:07:55.810 --> 00:07:56.940
with her psychic powers.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:58.780
She is an ESPer.

00:07:58.780 --> 00:07:59.860
Oh yeah...?

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:01.610
It appears everyone is here.

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:03.280
We should join them.

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:05.370
Hey...

00:08:05.370 --> 00:08:06.790
Stop ignoring me!

00:08:18.570 --> 00:08:22.800
CLASS S  RANK 17

00:08:18.570 --> 00:08:22.800
PURI-PURI PRISONER

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:22.800
Maybe this will be my chance
to get closer to Genos...

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:27.390
GENOS

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:27.390
CLASS S  RANK 16

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:27.390
It must be serious.
Almost everyone is here.

00:08:27.660 --> 00:08:30.890
CLASS S  RANK 15

00:08:27.660 --> 00:08:30.890
METAL BAT

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:30.890
Demon or Dragon, bring it on!

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:34.900
CLASS S  RANK 14

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:34.900
TANK-TOP MASTER

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:34.900
Saitama? The name rings a bell...

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:37.400
FLASHY FLASH

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:37.400
CLASS S  RANK 13

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:41.150
CLASS S  RANK 12

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:41.150
WATCHDOG MAN

00:08:39.320 --> 00:08:40.940
Somebody farted.

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:45.160
CLASS S  RANK 11

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:45.160
SUPERALLOY BLACKLUSTER

00:08:41.990 --> 00:08:45.240
They're all checking out
my guns. Hell yeah!

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:48.160
CLASS S  RANK 10

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:48.160
PIG GOD

00:08:48.430 --> 00:08:51.160
CLASS S  RANK 9

00:08:48.430 --> 00:08:51.160
DRIVE KNIGHT

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:57.170
CLASS S  RANK 8

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:57.170
ZOMBIEMAN

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:57.170
No one looks particularly enthusiastic.
And does that pig ever stop eating?

00:08:57.440 --> 00:09:00.670
CLASS S  RANK 7

00:08:57.440 --> 00:09:00.670
KING

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:03.680
CLASS S  RANK 6

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:03.680
METAL KNIGHT

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:03.680
ABSENT

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:09.180
CLASS S  RANK 5

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:09.180
CHILD EMPEROR

00:09:04.930 --> 00:09:08.850
Rank 1's a no show again?
I was hoping to see him.

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:14.520
CLASS S  RANK 4

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:14.520
ATOMIC SAMURAI

00:09:10.010 --> 00:09:14.560
Is Silverfang going to take
those youngsters on as students?

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:18.860
CLASS S  RANK 3

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:18.860
SILVERFANG

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:18.860
So... why are we all here?

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:24.240
Who knows? I had to drop everything
and then got kept waiting for two hours.

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:24.240
CLASS S  RANK 2

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:24.240
TERRIBLE TORNADO

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:27.240
CLASS S  RANK 1

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:27.240
BLAST

00:09:25.510 --> 00:09:27.240
ABSENT

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:30.990
CLASS B  RANK 63

00:09:27.510 --> 00:09:30.990
SAITAMA

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:30.490
Can I have some tea?

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:36.080
My apologies for being late.

00:09:36.810 --> 00:09:39.460
We do not know the whereabouts
of Metal Knight or Blast,

00:09:39.460 --> 00:09:41.170
nor can we reach them.

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:43.590
No sense waiting any longer,

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:45.340
so let's begin this emergency meeting.

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:46.970
You can call me Sitch.

00:09:46.970 --> 00:09:50.680
I'm with the Association.
I will be briefing you.

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:53.220
Let's get right down to brass tacks.

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:56.770
You heroes are here because
you're the best of the best.

00:09:56.770 --> 00:09:57.850
And now...

00:09:58.940 --> 00:10:02.190
We're asking you to save the Earth!

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:08.360
However, even with your Class S skills,
there is no guarantee of survival.

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:10.990
Walking away also takes courage.

00:10:10.990 --> 00:10:15.020
Should you choose to do so now,
you will retain Class S status.

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:19.960
But those who stay and hear me out
will not be allowed to walk away.

00:10:20.670 --> 00:10:24.340
You will be confined here
until the incident is over

00:10:24.340 --> 00:10:25.880
in order to avoid a general panic.

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:29.930
Are you all willing to hear this?

00:10:30.570 --> 00:10:31.850
Whatever's going on,

00:10:32.070 --> 00:10:35.850
it better be worth calling
all of us here.

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:39.850
I skipped out on my little sister's
piano recital for this.

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:41.730
If it's a load of crap,

00:10:42.210 --> 00:10:44.940
I'm gonna tear
this whole building apart.

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:47.780
Like you could do that
with that skinny stick.

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:51.070
Yeah? How 'bout I bust
your head open instead?

00:10:51.070 --> 00:10:54.740
If you think you can,
go on and try, pillbug head!

00:10:54.740 --> 00:10:57.200
Hurry up and get on with it.

00:10:57.200 --> 00:11:00.080
Otherwise Mr. Pompadour here
is going to die.

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:03.840
Hey, bobby pin,
you siding with the girls?

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:07.630
The great seer, Madame Shibabawa,
is dead!

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:11.050
Shibabawa? Was she killed?

00:11:11.110 --> 00:11:12.260
No.

00:11:12.260 --> 00:11:14.850
While looking into the future
for the next six months,

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:17.640
she became agitated and
had a coughing fit.

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:20.190
She popped a cough drop
in her mouth

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:22.650
and ended up choking on it...

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:23.940
I get it!

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:26.570
So we have to figure out
how to prevent disasters

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:28.070
without the help of predictions.

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:30.740
That's the focus of this meeting.

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:35.030
No. Madame Shibabawa
has only been able to predict

00:11:35.030 --> 00:11:36.910
a handful of disasters.

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:38.000
Excuse me!

00:11:38.390 --> 00:11:39.790
Hey, you there.

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:43.500
Who's this Shibabawa? A hero?

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:45.380
You don't know?

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:47.840
She's a seer.
A great one at that.

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:51.130
She correctly predicted earthquakes
and monster attacks.

00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:55.850
We've gotten through many crises
without Madame Shibabawa's predictions.

00:11:56.530 --> 00:11:58.890
But even so, we provided a bodyguard

00:11:58.890 --> 00:12:00.820
and gave her special treatment.

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:05.440
Yes, because her few predictions
were 100% accurate.

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:07.900
The crux of the problem, though,

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:11.780
is her last, greatest prophecy.

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:14.870
Even as she choked on
that final cough drop,

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:16.700
she managed to leave this note.

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:21.250
It is a prophecy that will
absolutely come to pass.

00:12:21.430 --> 00:12:22.540
Here it is!

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:24.750
Can you read it?

00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:26.790
– Th-The earth...
– Th-The earth...

00:12:26.790 --> 00:12:28.000
– ...is in trouble?!
– ...is in trouble?!

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:30.990
THE EARTH IS IN TROUBLE

00:12:31.010 --> 00:12:33.550
What? That's so dumb.

00:12:33.550 --> 00:12:35.640
Can I go? I have cram school.

00:12:35.640 --> 00:12:39.220
I know you are a prodigy,
Child Emperor,

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:43.900
but if you cannot grasp the danger,
it reveals how immature you still are.

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:45.560
What'd you say?!

00:12:45.560 --> 00:12:47.860
Listen up!

00:12:47.920 --> 00:12:51.400
Madame Shibabawa's predictions
are 100% accurate!

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:55.700
She has predicted many
catastrophes in the past.

00:12:55.700 --> 00:13:00.160
A few of them resulted in
the loss of countless lives.

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:06.170
But not once did Madame
Shibabawa use the word "trouble."

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:10.920
Something more dangerous than a Dragon
level catastrophe or monster is on its way.

00:13:10.920 --> 00:13:12.920
And it will occur...

00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:15.340
...in the next six months!

00:13:19.030 --> 00:13:23.060
Okay, but we've no idea
when in the next six months.

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:25.690
Yeah, hard to plan for that.

00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:27.770
You are correct.

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:32.360
But I want you all to be ready
for a fight in the next six months.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:34.570
In the next six months means...

00:13:34.570 --> 00:13:37.030
it could be tomorrow, or even today.

00:13:37.450 --> 00:13:40.950
That's true. Who are you, anyway?

00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:44.160
Good thing I'm here.

00:13:46.390 --> 00:13:48.290
The building is under attack!

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:50.040
That's impossible!

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:52.050
This is the Hero Association HQ!

00:14:01.720 --> 00:14:05.100
A formidable fortress, to be sure!

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:07.770
Time to attack.

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:10.480
Hawk, Eagle, Falcon, Kite!

00:14:10.480 --> 00:14:11.480
– Yar!
– Yar!

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:15.780
Wipe out these so-called heroes
and the land will belong to us!

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:17.950
We will dive straight in!

00:14:17.950 --> 00:14:20.490
Follow me, the Sky King!

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:22.950
Father...above us...

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:26.000
Escape...

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:31.790
Me, the Sky King, killed like
some worthless insect.

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:33.420
Who could have—

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:37.090
What was that?

00:14:37.090 --> 00:14:39.720
– Who knows?
– It flew, so we killed it.

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:41.010
That is good.

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:44.100
Duty, to protect ship.

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:09.790
Emergency power activated.

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:11.790
What was that?

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:13.840
What's going on out there?

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:15.050
I don't know.

00:15:15.050 --> 00:15:17.460
All communications have been cut off.

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:19.090
Damn it...

00:15:21.860 --> 00:15:22.890
Impossible!

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:31.100
Dad!

00:15:31.100 --> 00:15:33.150
We're okay now. Grab on to me.

00:15:33.150 --> 00:15:34.980
That's the way.

00:15:34.980 --> 00:15:37.070
Good job.

00:15:49.850 --> 00:15:51.210
What is this?

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:55.960
There are survivors?

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:59.130
– Ship, failed to kill all.
– Then we kill.

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:00.670
That is good.

00:16:04.240 --> 00:16:05.890
Get away now!

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:17.940
You think I don't sense
your thirst for blood?

00:16:17.940 --> 00:16:20.190
I accompanied Master Atomic

00:16:20.190 --> 00:16:22.990
and was waiting for
the Class S meeting to end,

00:16:22.990 --> 00:16:25.570
only to meet thunder
and destruction.

00:16:25.570 --> 00:16:27.780
Is this your doing?!

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:32.580
Destruction levels at 99.8%?

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:36.710
City A has been destroyed in an instant!

00:16:36.710 --> 00:16:40.760
Who could have known her prediction
would come true this soon?!

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:43.720
Hey! Why was this building spared?

00:16:43.720 --> 00:16:46.970
We assigned Metal Knight
to construct this building.

00:16:46.970 --> 00:16:49.770
That's why it's stronger
than the average shelter.

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:52.270
So that's why there're no windows.

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:57.320
We should go outside and see.
To be sure it's the prophecy.

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:59.980
Master! Will you—

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:04.070
Master...

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:09.160
That's big!
Are they aliens?

00:17:20.550 --> 00:17:23.010
So that's what blew
the city to pieces.

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:29.720
Go back to...

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:31.310
your planet!

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:39.150
A militant creature.

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:40.980
Also cautious.

00:17:40.980 --> 00:17:43.490
Hurry. Let us hurry and kill.

00:17:43.490 --> 00:17:44.820
That is good.

00:17:44.820 --> 00:17:46.740
Can it be killed?

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:54.700
Each of its strikes is lethal!

00:17:54.850 --> 00:17:56.880
I can't beat this thing...

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:59.710
Such a weak species.

00:17:59.710 --> 00:18:01.210
Easily killed.

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:02.840
That is good.

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:04.300
It's splitting?

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:06.340
Damn, not now...

00:18:06.340 --> 00:18:09.800
I will dispose of this.
You handle the rest.

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:10.970
Very well.

00:18:10.970 --> 00:18:13.770
I will go kill those that ran.

00:18:13.770 --> 00:18:14.930
That is good.

00:18:14.930 --> 00:18:15.930
I—

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:20.270
Master!

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:22.820
Iairon, you okay?

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:25.320
You know, your left arm...

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:28.820
Master! Swords have no effect
on this monster.

00:18:28.820 --> 00:18:30.950
Forget me! Retreat!

00:18:32.680 --> 00:18:33.830
Outta my way!

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:42.250
Iai! The path of the sword does
not end for you yet!

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:43.500
Stop bleeding!

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:45.420
Yes, Master!

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:57.640
So there is a life-form on
this planet that can fight.

00:18:57.640 --> 00:18:59.060
Excellent!

00:18:59.060 --> 00:19:02.020
Try to withstand our invasion!

00:19:02.250 --> 00:19:05.900
Planet, eh? You from outer space?

00:19:06.210 --> 00:19:08.950
And you got friends up
in that floaty toy?

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:11.530
Yeah, that's it.

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:16.200
I doubt you alone have the power
to do all this to the city.

00:19:16.640 --> 00:19:19.290
Atomic Samurai, count us in.

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:21.670
You the bastard that smashed
this town?!

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:24.670
And if I am?

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:26.920
For all the beautiful men
you killed...

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:28.470
I claim vengeance!

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:35.470
Each separate attack must
be delivered with intent...

00:19:35.470 --> 00:19:36.600
...to kill!

00:19:36.600 --> 00:19:38.350
Dark Angel

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:40.440
Flash!

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:48.900
Issue an evacuation warning to
City A and all neighboring cities.

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:49.690
Right now!

00:19:50.590 --> 00:19:54.740
And expand the System M vitals
monitor to cover all of City A.

00:19:54.740 --> 00:19:57.240
We need an accurate
count of the survivors.

00:19:57.240 --> 00:19:58.580
What's the threat level?

00:19:58.580 --> 00:20:00.000
"Dragon," without doubt.

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:03.040
No...

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:06.090
This might be "God."

00:20:08.480 --> 00:20:11.800
Four Class S heroes can take care
of the enemy on the ground...

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:13.800
The problem is that.

00:20:13.800 --> 00:20:15.720
We can't reach it.

00:20:15.720 --> 00:20:18.890
Any aircraft would be
shot down in seconds.

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:22.690
King, you're one of
the top fighters in Class S.

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:24.560
Give us your take.

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:26.770
King, Class S rank 7.

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:29.820
Said to be the strongest man
on Earth,

00:20:29.820 --> 00:20:32.860
and I see he is well respected
by the other heroes...

00:20:34.630 --> 00:20:36.570
There's nothing I can do.

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:41.290
It's too high in the sky.
There's no way to attack it.

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:45.380
But the mysterious craft
is currently dormant.

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:47.840
We should use this opportunity
to call in Metal Knight.

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:50.630
What the—?! That's pathetic!

00:20:50.630 --> 00:20:52.800
Aren't you supposed
to be the strongest man?

00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:54.630
Hey, Tornado.

00:20:54.630 --> 00:20:56.800
– If you piss King off, he'll kill you.
– This city's been blown away,

00:20:56.800 --> 00:20:58.970
and you're just going
to give them a free hand?

00:20:58.970 --> 00:20:59.970
Unbelievable!

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:05.560
Well forget it!
I'll take care of this myself.

00:21:05.560 --> 00:21:07.320
Wait, I will go too.

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:10.530
I do not know how effective I can be,

00:21:10.530 --> 00:21:12.690
but I will attack from the ground.

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:15.240
Maybe you didn't hear me.

00:21:15.240 --> 00:21:17.160
I said forget about it!

00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:20.120
Take it easy, Genos.

00:21:20.120 --> 00:21:23.160
I understand how you feel,
but if you piss her off, she'll kill you.

00:21:23.640 --> 00:21:25.120
Very well...

00:21:25.120 --> 00:21:27.630
There is no need to
team up anyway.

00:21:28.170 --> 00:21:32.010
Master has already boarded
the enemy ship.

00:21:32.010 --> 00:21:34.300
Whether this is the prophecy or not,

00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:37.010
there's not a single evil
Master cannot defeat.

00:21:37.010 --> 00:21:40.350
If such an evil existed,

00:21:40.350 --> 00:21:43.560
then I assume the human race
would have perished long ago.

00:21:48.500 --> 00:21:51.230
Well done making it this far, intruder!

00:21:51.230 --> 00:21:53.030
But this is the end.

00:21:53.030 --> 00:21:57.280
You see, there is no way
you can defeat me, Groribas!

00:21:57.280 --> 00:22:00.910
My Acid Breath will melt you away!

00:22:14.690 --> 00:22:17.430
Isn't it about time the boss
showed up?

00:22:17.820 --> 00:22:19.850
Well, if he's alive...

00:22:29.930 --> 00:22:29.980